    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Setup\n1. This webhook (`marketing-journey-enroll`) is meant to be called whenever a customer should start the journey — e.g. from your own booking/CRM system, a Zapier/Make step, or manually for testing. Send `{ \"name\": ..., \"email\": ..., \"channel\": \"email\", \"businessName\": ..., \"subscribedToMarketing\": true }`.\n2. Add SMTP credentials to each **Send Email** node (Welcome/Reminder/Testimonial/Offer) — click the node, choose or create SMTP credentials in n8n's credential manager.\n3. Replace `notifications@YOUR-BLUEFLOW-DOMAIN.example` in each Send Email node with your real sending address.\n4. This is the n8n-native equivalent of Blueflow's own Marketing Automation journey engine (`app/Workflow/JourneyStepAdvancer.php`) — same Welcome → wait → Reminder → wait → Testimonial → wait → Offer shape, just using n8n's built-in **Wait** node to pause between steps instead of a database-backed enrollment/clock.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "14ab6331-0cee-4a59-810b-b5536a3caee8",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Wait nodes\nEach **Wait** node pauses the whole execution in place (n8n persists it, no polling/cron needed) for the configured amount — 1 day after Welcome, 2 days after Reminder, 2 days after Testimonial. Adjust the `amount`/`unit` on each Wait node to match your own cadence.\n\nBecause days can pass between steps, consider re-checking `subscribedToMarketing` (e.g. an HTTP Request back to your own customer-lookup endpoint) before each send in a production version — this template only checks it once, right after enrollment.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "0f2388ee-4545-4614-9226-5adafa84ee44",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1200,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Multi-channel\nOnly Email is wired up for real here, matching what Blueflow's native engine actually supports today. To add WhatsApp/SMS/Telegram:\n1. Add another **Channel: X?** IF node (copy \"Channel: Email?\", change the comparison value).\n2. Replace this NoOp with the matching n8n node once you have real provider credentials — e.g. the **WhatsApp Business Cloud** node, a **Twilio** node for SMS, or the **Telegram** node.\n3. Until then this branch intentionally does nothing, the same way `SendWhatsAppStep`/`SendSmsStep`/`SendTelegramStep` report `channel_not_configured` in the native engine rather than pretending to send.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "5b7cbf72-da89-43e0-b665-13a101b42d8a",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        700,
        780
      ]
    }
  ],
